  invaderName: Bacteriophage
  description: A type of virus which infects specific species of bacteria. It reproduces
    within the bacteria before killing the host and infecting other nearby bacteria.
    While some may kill harmful bacteria, this one is intent on destroying those
    which the body relies on.
